--- a/INSTALL.rst
+++ b/INSTALL.rst
@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@ Requirements
 - Fortran compiler : GNU Fortran, Intel Fortran or IBM XL Fortran
 - `GNU make`_
 - `Autoconf`_
-- `Python`_ > 3.0
+- `Python`_ > 3.7
 - |IRPF90| : Fortran code generator
